## Design System

- **Primary Palette:** Light blue family — `#2563EB` (primary), `#60A5FA` (sky), `#1E3A8A` (royal), `#0F1D3D` (navy)
- **Accent:** Amber/Orange — `#F59E0B` (accent), `#D97706` (hot)
- **Supporting:** Mint `#10B981`, Violet `#8B5CF6`, Coral `#F43F5E`
- **Neutral:** Void `#070E1F` to White `#FFFFFF` gray scale
- **Typography:** Plus Jakarta Sans (headings), DM Sans (body), JetBrains Mono (code/tech elements)
- **Aesthetic:** Premium SaaS / tech-forward with dark hero sections, terminal-style code cards, gradient accents, glass effects
- **Tone:** Bold, energetic, motivational, professional — speaks to hustlers and go-getters

## Financing

- Monthly payment plans starting at $399/mo
- No hard credit pull for pre-qualification
- 24hr approval decisions
- 0% interest for qualifying applicants
- Revenue share options available
- Sample plan: $15,000 bundle → $625/mo over 24 months at 5.9% APR

## Site Architecture

```
Home Page
├── Hero (terminal deploy animation + CTA)
├── Logo Scroll Bar (industries served)
├── Six Pillars (tech stack cards)
├── Business Solutions Grid (8 bundle cards)
├── How It Works (4-step timeline)
├── What's Included (dark section, 6 platform cards with tech tags)
├── Financing (checklist + payment calculator card)
├── Testimonials (3 review cards)
├── CTA Banner
├── Contact (info blocks + form with solution selector)
└── Footer (NGV attribution, social links)

Product Detail Pages (per bundle)
├── Detail Hero (back link, tag, title, image)
├── What We Build (feature list + sidebar pricing card)
└── CTA Banner
```

## Key Technical Details

- Single HTML file with client-side JS routing (no framework dependency)
- All CSS inline (no external stylesheets beyond Google Fonts)
- Scroll-reveal animations via IntersectionObserver pattern
- Chat widget (UI mockup — needs real service integration)
- Contact form (UI mockup — needs backend integration like Formspree)
- Responsive breakpoints: 1080px, 768px, 480px
- Images: Unsplash stock (replace with branded photos for production)

## Integration Notes (Pending)

- Chat: Consider Tawk.to, Crisp, or Bland AI for live chat
- Forms: Wire to Formspree, Netlify Forms, or custom webhook (Slack integration exists for Thee Concierge)
- Hosting: Deploy to Netlify, Vercel, or custom domain
- Analytics: Google Analytics / Tag Manager not yet integrated
- Payment: Stripe for checkout / financing applications not yet wired

